  {
   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Meridew Analytics is in breach of its Revenue to Plan covenant for the period ended October 31, 2026, with revenue at {{fact:32b5f800-7ba4-40ae-a06e-98552fb2dd87}} of plan against a required {{fact:97c5f746-53de-4edc-8b8d-533a44d4b33e}}. The borrower's compliance certificate reports the same figure and does not claim compliance on this covenant. The liquidity covenants, Minimum Runway and Minimum Unrestricted Cash, are met. The breach work item has already been decided for escalation to committee, so the decision now sits with the committee.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Revenue to Plan is in breach: the bank calculates {{fact:32b5f800-7ba4-40ae-a06e-98552fb2dd87}} against a floor of {{fact:97c5f746-53de-4edc-8b8d-533a44d4b33e}}, a cushion of {{fact:ae43e3ef-1fea-4417-960e-f71e423237bb}}. The certificate reports {{fact:76cd453d-92fa-4e7f-9576-e17ea7ae2ed6}} and acknowledges non-compliance. Minimum Unrestricted Cash is compliant at {{fact:29cd8d28-78a3-4c0b-a29d-b33eca788e0c}} against a required {{fact:69ddefe1-73f7-4ffa-9ce8-bbaef95ad183}}, a cushion of {{fact:8d80b4d7-54c2-4f69-a386-50366ce31c62}}. Minimum Runway is compliant at {{fact:41a2006b-f125-44f8-b7ba-13d86f29ed2b}} against a required {{fact:befa1ac1-1d81-41e6-a746-34cbc886df52}}, a cushion of {{fact:5939d075-63ef-4ede-8816-24741e735698}}. On all three covenants, the certificate matches the bank's calculation.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"Two medium-severity signals relate to the revenue shortfall. The first flags revenue covenant headroom below the floor. The second flags revenue below plan, which for a SaaS borrower may reflect weaker bookings, churn or delayed renewals. The underlying cause is not established in the facts held. A low-severity signal reports revenue covenant headroom falling over successive months, which indicates a worsening trend. A second low-severity signal reports a steady decline in unrestricted cash headroom; a reviewer may want to assess whether this reflects cash burn. The covenant breach work item has been decided as an escalation to committee. No other work items are open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
